{"seq":1,"slug":"errors-and-authority","title":"Errors And Authority","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/controversies-and-appraisal/errors-and-authority","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"scientific-errors","title":"科学上的错误","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/controversies-and-appraisal/errors-and-authority/scientific-errors","wordCount":2111,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-burden-of-authority","title":"权威的负担","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/controversies-and-appraisal/errors-and-authority/the-burden-of-authority","wordCount":1798,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<p>本章审视亚里士多德在科学上的错误及其权威的负担。亚里士多德在物理学（物体下落学说）、天文学（地心说）等领域的某些结论，被后世证明是错误的，这些错误主要源于其时代科学方法的局限。而他至高的权威，在被奉为不可置疑的教条之后，又在一定程度上束缚了思想、阻碍了科学进步。本章揭示&quot;权威&quot;与&quot;思想进步&quot;之间深刻的张力。</p>\n"}